            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Eric D. Miller, on behalf of the Petitioner, congress added \u00a7\u00a7416(h)(2)(B) and 416(h)(3) as alternative mechanisms that allow children who lack intestacy rights to qualify for survivor benefits."
      }
