          ],
          "text": "According to Eric D. Miller, on behalf of the Petitioner, the petitioner maintains that the SSA must apply State intestacy law to determine child survivor benefit eligibility, as the statute\u2019s text, structure, and history support this interpretation."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Eric D. Miller, on behalf of the Petitioner",
