              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-46081876c294-0000-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 5,
                "start": 5
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Eric D. Miller, on behalf of the Petitioner, the petitioner points to \u00a7\u00a7416(h)(2)(B) and 416(h)(3) as congressional alternatives that allow children lacking intestacy rights to qualify, emphasizing that a written acknowledgment or court decree can deem an applicant a child."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Rothfeld",
          "citations": [
            {
